@startuml
title Singleton Pattern - Class Diagram

class Logger {
  -instance: Logger {static}
  -logs: List<String>
  -Logger()
  +{static} getInstance(): Logger
  +log(message: String): void
  +getLogs(): List<String>
}

note right of Logger
  Private constructor guarantees a single
  instance. getInstance() is synchronized
  and lazily creates it on first call.
end note

@enduml
